<title>USA: California Financial Q3 shr loss at $0.22.</title>
<headline>California Financial Q3 shr loss at $0.22.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKTON, Calif 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.22	   profit $0.32</p>
<p> Net loss	  1,041	   profit 1,525</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,808		    4,715</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.92	   profit $0.33</p>
<p> Net profit	4,409	   profit 1,564</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,784		    4,706</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is California Financial Holding Co.</p>
<p>1996 third-quarter and nine-month figures ended September 30.</p>
<p>Q3 loss due to the recording of a $6.6 million expense representing Stockton Savings Bank's share of an industry-wide special assessment. This assessment was calculated at 0.657 percent of insured deposits as of March 31, 1995. The assessment was recorded as part of the company's non-interest expense this quarter.</p>
</text>
